WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.500
[Fax machine] Then the fax
sends documents over a distance.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.350
A sheet goes in here…

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.380
its copy appears somewhere else.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.450
[Electronic sound] With websites,
information is available at any hour.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.400
It opens a door to your ideas.
